  "description": "My husband loved my twin so much that on our very own wedding anniversary, he dared to commit adultery right in my home.\n\nThe day after I uncovered the sickening truth, I confronted my twin, Gloria.\n\nIf he’s going to sleep around with other women anyway, isn’t it better he does it with me, since I look exactly like you?\nIt was nothing but the absolute ravings of a madwoman.\nI fully intended to throw Gloria out of the estate and demand a divorce, but…\n\nIn the blink of an eye, the tables were completely turned.\nSuddenly, everyone was calling me Gloria— the deranged widow who coveted her sister’s husband.\n\nI am Marianne! The mistress of this house, Marianne Drake!\nBut no matter how much I screamed the truth, no one listened.\n\nYou claim to be Marianne? Please come to your senses, Duchess!\n\nI broke down as the realization finally hit me. My husband was planning to completely replace me with my twin.\n\nBut what kind of cruel twist of fate is this? Banished to the ducal estate to live out my days as Gloria…\nMy twin’s husband, whom everyone believed to be dead, returned alive.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=852058), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14359543)",
